      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "navigation",
      "description": "Amostra dos links desktop; o menu móvel e a conta reutilizam o comportamento da aplicação.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\" aria-label=\"Produtos\"><a href=\"https://forcaaliada.com/manager\">Manager</a><a href=\"https://forcaaliada.com/community\">Community</a><a href=\"https://forcaaliada.com/minecraft\">Minecraft</a></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:29px;background:var(--night,#151b20);font-family:Manrope,system-ui,sans-serif;}.ds-nav a{position:relative;padding-block:26px;font-size:13px;font-weight:650;line-height:1.6;color:#dce4df;text-decoration:none;transition:color .18s}.ds-nav a:after{content:\"\";position:absolute;bottom:19px;left:0;right:0;height:2px;transform:scaleX(0);transform-origin:left;background:var(--green,#43cd75);transition:transform .25s var(--ease,cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1))}.ds-nav a:hover{color:#fff}.ds-nav a:hover:after{transform:scaleX(1)}.ds-nav a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--focus,#318bd1);outline-offset:4px;}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-nav a,.ds-nav a:after{transition:none}}"
